    "code": " def watching_minute(n, a):\n\n    if a[0] > 15:\n\n        return 15\n\n    if len(a) == 1:\n\n        return a[0] + 15\n\n    for i in range(len(a) - 1):\n\n        if a[i + 1] - a[i] > 15:\n\n            return a[i] + 15\n\n        if a[i + 1] >= 75 or a[i] >= 75:\n\n            return 90\n\n        if i + 1 == len(a) - 1 and a[i + 1] < 75:\n\n            return a[i + 1] + 15\n\nn = int(input())\n\na = [int(i) for i in input().split()]\n\nprint(watching_minute(n, a))",
